OL,3,ACharles 'sounded giddily elated' after
OL,4,ADiana died, Earl Spencer claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarl Spencer, brother of Diana,
OL,7,FPrincess of Wales, has claimed King
OL,8,FCharles "sounded giddily elated" when
OL,9,Fhe called him after her death in 1997.
OL,11,FIn a controversial book about Diana, he
OL,12,Falleged the then-Prince Charles sounded
OL,13,Flike a "lottery winner" after the news.
OL,15,FBuckingham Palace strongly pushed back
OL,16,Fon Wednesday against the credibility of
OL,17,Fthe book, after an initial extract
OL,18,Fclaimed Charles had said of Diana:
OL,19,F"We'll forget her soon enough."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
