OL,3,AKing Charles warns of 'existential
OL,4,Adanger' of AI falling into wrong hands
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has warned AI executives
OL,7,Fof the "existential dangers" posed by
OL,8,Fthe technology falling into the wrong
OL,9,Fhands.
OL,11,FHe made the comments at a summit he had
OL,12,Fconvened at Dumfries House in Ayrshire
OL,13,Fto discuss how the tech can be used to
OL,14,Fbenefit society.
OL,16,FThose gathered at the meeting also
OL,17,Fincluded Kanishka Narayan, the UK's AI
OL,18,FMinister, the Pope's advisor, and
OL,19,Fparticipants from AI giants such as
OL,20,FNvidia, OpenAI and Anthropic.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
